# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of the checking-out
# machine's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites every file to CRLF on checkout, which then
# fails eslint's prettier/prettier rule (this project's .prettierrc has no
# endOfLine override, so prettier's LF default applies) -- every fresh
# clone/checkout on Windows would otherwise start from a failing `bun run
# lint` with zero code changes.
* text=lf
